/-!
# Intrinsic identification of the selected field component

The selected component supplies a simple central quotient of three-rank two
with an involutory automorphism and an ordinary PSL₃(2) fixed component.
The full Theorem C classification is available from the precise universal
earlier source theorem, and every alternating entry is excluded by permutation
centralizer orders. The remaining model sieve and exceptional-cover
identification are not asserted by these preparation lemmas.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, combined 1 March 2004 manuscript, proof of 15.3.38,
printed p.1137; Theorems A and C, p.33; A.3.6, pp.43--45; A.3.18, pp.51--52.
-/
